 * Publishes Deal_Stage_Change__e platform events for Opportunities.
 *
 * DEVIATION FROM THE REQUESTED IMPLEMENTATION:
 * EventBus.publish is intentionally NOT called once per Opportunity inside
 * the loop. Instead, all events are collected and published with a single
 * bulk EventBus.publish(List<SObject>) call.
 *
 * This does not lose per-event failure information: the bulk overload
 * returns one Database.SaveResult per event, in exactly the same order as
 * the events supplied, so result[i] corresponds to opportunities[i] just
 * as it would with individual calls. The bulk form is the documented,
 * bulk-safe pattern for up to 200 trigger records (and beyond): it avoids
 * 200 separate publish invocations in one transaction, their per-call
 * overhead and any publish-call governor pressure, while event-for-event
 * allocation usage is unchanged.
 *
 * Note also that because the event is defined as "publish after commit",
 * a successful SaveResult means the event was accepted for publication;
 * it is only delivered to subscribers (e.g. the data warehouse) after the
 * publishing transaction commits.
 */
public with sharing class DealEventPublisher {

    /**
     * Publishes one Deal_Stage_Change__e per Opportunity.
     *
     * @param opportunities Opportunities to publish events for.
     * @return Publish results in the same order as the input list.
     *         An empty (or null) input publishes nothing and returns
     *         an empty list.
     */
    public static List<Database.SaveResult> publishStageChanges(List<Opportunity> opportunities) {
        if (opportunities == null || opportunities.isEmpty()) {
            return new List<Database.SaveResult>();
        }

        List<Deal_Stage_Change__e> events = new List<Deal_Stage_Change__e>();
        for (Opportunity opp : opportunities) {
            events.add(new Deal_Stage_Change__e(
                // String.valueOf on an Id yields the 18-character form.
                Opportunity_Id__c = (opp?.Id == null) ? null : String.valueOf(opp.Id),
                Stage__c = opp?.StageName,
                Amount__c = opp?.Amount
            ));
        }

        // Single bulk publish; SaveResults come back in input order.
        return EventBus.publish(events);
    }
}
